东濊人入侵百济。责稽王率军亲自防御，在战斗中阵亡。","tc":"百濟第九代君主，古爾王的長子，身長大，志氣雄傑。古爾王崩后繼位，元康八年，晉朝的樂浪郡太守聯合東濊人入侵百濟。責稽王率軍親自防御，在戰斗中陣亡。","en":"The 9th ruler of Baekje and the eldest son of King Goi, tall in stature and of heroic spirit. He succeeded the throne upon King Goi's demise. In the eighth year of Yuankang, the Jin dynasty's Governor of Lelang Commandery allied with the Dongye to invade Baekje. King Chaekgye personally led his army in defense and was slain in battle.","jp":"百済第九代君主。古尓王の長子。長身で、志気雄傑であった。古尓王の崩御後に即位した。元康八年、晋の楽浪郡太守が東濊と連合して百済に侵攻した際、責稽王は自ら軍を率いて防御にあたったが、戦闘の中で陣没した。","kr":"백제의 제9대 군주이자 고이왕의 장남으로, 신장이 크고 지기가 웅걸했습니다. 고이왕이 붕어한 후 즉위하였으며, 원강 8년 진나라의 낙랑군 태수가 동예인과 연합하여 백제를 침공하자, 책계왕이 친히 군을 이끌고 방어에 나섰으나 전투 중에 전사했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1050815","remark":"统帅","surname":"","surnameTc":"","surnameEn":"","surnameJp":"","surnameKr":"","surnameOther":"","name":"責稽","nameTc":"責稽","nameEn":"Chaekgye","nameJp":"責稽","nameKr":"책계","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"責稽","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"190","city":"CS1068","gender":"0","rule":"64","force":"80","wise":"48","politics":"44","charm":"78","will":"58","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"6","wiseTalent":"5","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"40/42/80/48/45/46/41/39","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5200","battleSoulPoint":"4700","debateSoulPoint":"3200","strategy":"1000301","strategy2":"1008501","professions":"2/3/3/2/0/0/2/0/1/1/0/0/2/2/1/0/2/1/1/1/0/2/2/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"3","compatible":"95","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"-6800","t